%p
  The contract for work order
  %strong= @work_order.number
  has been signed.

%table{ style: "width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;" }
  %tbody
    %tr
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;font-weight:600;width:160px;" } Work Order
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;" }= @work_order.number
    %tr
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;font-weight:600;" } Title
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;" }= @work_order.title
    %tr
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;font-weight:600;" } Client
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;" }= @work_order.client_display_name
    %tr
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;font-weight:600;" } Total
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;" }= humanized_money_with_symbol(@work_order.total)
    %tr
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;font-weight:600;" } Signed At
      %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;" }= @work_order.contracted_at&.to_fs(:long)

%p{ style: "margin-top:24px;" }
  Deposit invoices have been automatically generated and sent to the client.
